vendor/wsz987/ holds patched copies of three packages from wsz987/dsh-channels,
not a work of the dsh-workbench contributors. They are bundled into
lib/channel-telegram.mjs (the 通道 › Telegram runtime).

  Copyright (c) 2026 wsz987
  License: MIT (vendor/wsz987/<package>/LICENSE)
  Upstream: https://github.com/wsz987/dsh-channels

    channel-core, channel-harness, channel-telegram
      @wsz987/channel-core, @wsz987/channel-harness, @wsz987/channel-telegram 0.5.1

  Local edits are exactly the patch files in vendor/wsz987/patches (long-poll
  stall guard and watchdog, streamed-text dedupe, inbound preemption, and
  forwarding tool-result images to the channel). npm run vendor:channels
  regenerates the copies from the npm tarballs plus those patches, and
  npm run check verifies them. The wsz987 copyright notice and MIT permission
  text must stay with these files.

lib/channel-telegram.mjs also bundles DeepSeek Harness packages
